{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve the equation \\(\\log_{x-1}(10-2x) = 2\\), we need to convert the logarithmic equation into its exponential form. The equation \\(\\log_{x-1}(10-2x) = 2\\) can be rewritten as:\n\n\\[\n(x-1)^2 = 10 - 2x\n\\]\n\nNext, we expand and simplify the equation:\n\n\\[\n(x-1)^2 = x^2 - 2x + 1\n\\]\n\\[\nx^2 - 2x + 1 = 10 - 2x\n\\]\n\nWe can eliminate the \\(-2x\\) term from both sides of the equation:\n\n\\[\nx^2 + 1 = 10\n\\]\n\nSubtract 1 from both sides:\n\n\\[\nx^2 = 9\n\\]\n\nTaking the square root of both sides, we get:\n\n\\[\nx = 3 \\quad \\text{or} \\quad x = -3\n\\]\n\n","prefix_end":530,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,279,23606,1124,11520,839,15159,87,12,16,25547,16,15,12,17,87,8,284,220,17,59,701,582,1184,311,5508,279,89936,21220,23606,1119,1181,58755,1352,13,576,23606,1124,11520,839,15159,87,12,16,25547,16,15,12,17,87,8,284,220,17,57758,646,387,58524,438,1447,59,9640,2075,12,16,29776,17,284,220,16,15,481,220,17,87,198,59,2533,5847,11,582,9225,323,39721,279,23606,1447,59,9640,2075,12,16,29776,17,284,856,61,17,481,220,17,87,488,220,16,198,59,921,59,9640,87,61,17,481,220,17,87,488,220,16,284,220,16,15,481,220,17,87,198,59,2533,1654,646,21725,279,1124,4080,17,87,57758,4647,504,2176,11067,315,279,23606,1447,59,9640,87,61,17,488,220,16,284,220,16,15,198,59,2533,3136,2144,220,16,504,2176,11067,1447,59,9640,87,61,17,284,220,24,198,59,2533,50097,279,9334,3704,315,2176,11067,11,582,633,1447,59,9640,87,284,220,18,1124,31610,1124,1318,90,269,92,1124,31610,856,284,481,18,198,59,2533,11209,11,582,1184,311,1779,421,1493,9904,26553,279,4024,89936,21220,23606,13,576,2331,315,279,89936,76,11,17767,87,12,16,59,701,1969,387,6785,323,537,6144,311,220,16,13,15277,11,17767,87,12,16,861,220,15,57758,323,17767,87,12,16,1124,811,80,220,16,59,701,892,3363,17767,87,861,220,16,57758,323,17767,87,1124,811,80,220,17